        "type": "features",
        "variant": "numbered-list",
        "html": "<section class=\"bg-bg\">\n  <div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-s5 px-s4 py-s6 md:grid-cols-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"max-w-md text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:col-span-4\">Three controls, enforced at the gateway</h2>\n    <ol class=\"md:col-span-8\">\n      <li class=\"grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] gap-s2 border-t border-line py-s3\"><span class=\"text-sm text-muted\">01</span><p><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Prompt injection defense.</span> <span class=\"text-muted\">Hostile instructions are stripped before the model sees them.</span></p></li>\n      <li class=\"grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] gap-s2 border-t border-line py-s3\"><span class=\"text-sm text-muted\">02</span><p><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Data leakage controls.</span> <span class=\"text-muted\">Sensitive data is masked or blocked, in prompts and in answers.</span></p></li>\n      <li class=\"grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] gap-s2 border-y border-line py-s3\"><span class=\"text-sm text-muted\">03</span><p><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">Audit trail.</span> <span class=\"text-muted\">Every request and decision is logged and exportable.</span></p></li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n</section>",
